  "instructions": [
    "In a large mixing bowl, combine chickpea flour and water to create a smooth batter.",
    "Add sweet potato, ginger, cinnamon, and yeast to the batter, and mix until well combined.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a kazan and cook over medium heat, stirring constantly, until the mixture thickens and forms a foamy head.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 45 minutes, or until the stew has reached a thick, creamy consistency.",
    "Remove the kazan from the heat and let cool slightly before serving."
